  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnerships for Equality: No to Hate Speech and Divisive Narratives in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to combat hate speech and divisive narratives in Bosnia and Herzegovina (BiH) which are both symptoms of discrimination and key drivers of societal polarization and conflict. By supporting coordination among a diverse range of governmental and non-governmental stakeholders across the country, the project aims to enhance awareness and understanding of hate speech patterns, strengthen prevention efforts, and promote adequate responses &#x2013; ultimately contributing to greater trust,</narrative>
  </description>
